# Shared secrets for all trackers (see each tracker's README for details).
# NTFY_TOPIC: used by every tracker — a long random string is your only password on free ntfy.sh.
# HC_PING_KEY: optional — healthchecks.io project ping key (Settings > Ping key); each tracker
#   pings its check after every good check and healthchecks.io alerts when the pings stop.
#   Run ./healthchecks-setup.sh once to create the checks (needs HC_API_KEY here meanwhile).
# LAT / LON: chicken-breast only — your coordinates (they reveal your home; picks the Blinkit dark store).
NTFY_TOPIC=
LAT=
LON=
HC_PING_KEY=
